/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is a tool for defining and managing multi-container Docker applications. It allows you to describe the services your application consists of, along with networks, volumes, and dependencies, in a single YAML file. This simplifies the orchestration and management of multi-service applications.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
